Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Cicadas Swallow the Magnet Ring
- Story & Context: The recording began at dawn when millions of island cicadas invaded the ventilation ducts of the accelerator, their deafening rattle bleeding into the open ribbon microphones just as Wayne struck the opening slide riff. Sound technician Kenji tore down the baffles instead of fighting the noise, cranking the tube preamps until the cicadas and Mariko’s soaring three-part vocal melody locked into the same blinding frequency, immortalizing the opening shout: "Let the current burn our wings, honey, we’re running on pure daylight now!"
